{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Between is a text-based roguelike RPG that plunges you into a haunting realm of forgotten gods, living nightmares, and shifting memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is different. Battle terrifying creatures, evolve your powers, and unlock chilling fragments of a world lost to time. As you die, you grow stronger and uncover the unsettling truth behind Velmora, the keeper of memories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 unique skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">27 skill evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave like enemy combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">14 distinct enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 powerful boss-like enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 random events that dramatically alter your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich, immersive lore to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill Awakening system for strategic combat depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paragon enemies with challenging modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom skill creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique run collectables called &quot;relics&quot;</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735020?t=1749606420","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735020?t=1749606420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735020/4b2da226c2e9cc9f4b7ec7728fbfd5b1dbce7306/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749606420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735020/4b2da226c2e9cc9f4b7ec7728fbfd5b1dbce7306/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749606420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descrip